<title>AUSTRIA: Wlaschek third bidder for CA - Klima.</title>
<headline>Wlaschek third bidder for CA - Klima.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian entrepreneur Karl Wlaschek, former owner of the Billa supermarket chain, is the third bidder for Creditanstalt-Bankverein, the Austrian finance ministry said on Monday.</p>
</text>
